      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I am facing an issue in ERPNext v16 related to the Lead doctype.<br>\nInside a Lead, under the <strong>Activities</strong> tab and the <strong>Notes</strong> tab, the options to <strong>add a Task</strong> or <strong>add a Note</strong> are not appearing.</p>\n<p>What I have already tried:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Checked Role Permissions Manager</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Verified Task and Note doctypes — all permissions seem correct</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cleared cache (<code>bench clear-cache</code>, <code>bench clear-website-cache</code>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Reloaded doctype</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tried in Incognito browser</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Restarted bench multiple times</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Still, the <strong>New Task</strong> and <strong>New Note</strong> buttons are missing. Only comments and “New Email / New Event” are visible.</p>\n<p>Screenshots of the issue:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/a/9ab85c685a754050fb4e6e851cc76f633db0c112.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9ab85c685a754050fb4e6e851cc76f633db0c112\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-11-25 111241\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9ab85c685a754050fb4e6e851cc76f633db0c112_2_690x349.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-25 111241\" data-base62-sha1=\"m4IwmzchRqKdjlJu1g8yQzjiApQ\" width=\"690\" height=\"349\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9ab85c685a754050fb4e6e851cc76f633db0c112_2_690x349.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9ab85c685a754050fb4e6e851cc76f633db0c112_2_1035x523.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9ab85c685a754050fb4e6e851cc76f633db0c112_2_1380x698.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-11-25 111241</span><span class=\"informations\">1919×973 88.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/a/ea878236cac23efa817980b659540a21f93d0869.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ea878236cac23efa817980b659540a21f93d0869\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-11-25 111232\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/a/ea878236cac23efa817980b659540a21f93d0869_2_690x346.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-25 111232\" data-base62-sha1=\"xsK3lFP92HV2aoY5p9IgPoDXhwd\" width=\"690\" height=\"346\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/a/ea878236cac23efa817980b659540a21f93d0869_2_690x346.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/a/ea878236cac23efa817980b659540a21f93d0869_2_1035x519.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/a/ea878236cac23efa817980b659540a21f93d0869_2_1380x692.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-11-25 111232</span><span class=\"informations\">1919×965 89.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Can someone please confirm if I am missing something in configuration, or if this is a <strong>bug in v16</strong>?</p>\n<p>Thank you!</p>",
